# Changelog 
All notable changes to Mhlongo Dzonga Fresh Bakery Website. 
## [1.3.0] - 2026-09-10
### Added 
- Added Buyer Order Form on menu.html with fields: Full Name, What they want, How many items 
- Added 6 different products on menu page using 5 different pictures + 1 sepia filter trick 
- Added Testing Evidence section to README.md with Desktop, Tablet, Mobile screenshots 
- Added order form JavaScript - auto-fill when clicking Order Now and shows confirmation message 
- Added responsive testing screenshots in images folder 
### Fixed 
- Fixed layout to ensure images resize appropriately and do not overflow page (width:100%, object-fit:cover) 
## [1.2.0] - 2026-09-15 
### Added 
- Implemented Desktop Layout requirements 
- Added CSS Grid for menu-grid (3 columns desktop) 
- Added Flexbox for navigation and header layout 
### Fixed 
- Implemented Responsive Design 
- Added media queries and breakpoints: 
    - Desktop: 3 columns (default) 
    - Tablet: 2 columns @ 900px breakpoint 
    - Mobile: 1 column @ 600px breakpoint 
- Added relative units: %, fr, rem, vw 
- Added hover, focus, active effects on buttons (scale and colour change) 
- Improved typography and colour combinations (brown #3e2723, orange #ff8c00) 
## [1.1.0] - 2026-09-09 
### Added 
- Added 5 pages: index.html, about.html, menu.html, services.html, contact.html 
- Added images folder with bread.jpg, biscuits.jpg, mango.jpg, about.jpg, bg.jpg 
- Added navigation linking all pages 
- Added footer and hero sections 
## [1.0.0] - 2026-09-05 
### Added 

- Initial project setup 

- Created style.css with basic styling 

- Created project folder structure WEB-DEV 
